    "state_note": "In force since 31 March 2022, and firms had to operate within impact tolerances by 31 March 2025. The critical third parties regime has applied since 1 January 2025, and new incident and third party reporting rules apply from 18 March 2027.",
    "tier": "sector",
    "applies_to": "Banks, building societies, PRA-designated investment firms, insurers, payment and e-money institutions and other in-scope FCA firms. Cloud and SaaS vendors feel it through outsourcing contract terms.",
